{
  "TitleJP": "激戦（２）",
  "TitleKR": "격전 2",
  "TitleEN": "A Fearsome Clash 2",
  "TitleTH": "สงครามร้อน 2",
  "TitleTW": "激戰（２）",
  "DescJP": "全力でぶつかり合うヒナとホシノ。戦闘の余波は大オアシス駅に向かっていた列車を覆う。",
  "DescKR": "호시노와 히나는 전력으로 맞붙고, 전투의 여파는 대 오아시스 역으로 향하던 기차를 고스란히 덮친다.",
  "DescEN": "Hoshino and Hina engage in a fierce battle, dealing heavy collateral damage to the train en route to the Great Oasis Station.",
  "DescTH": "โฮชิโนะกับฮินะต่อสู้กันด้วยกำลังทั้งหมดที่มี การต่อสู้นี้ส่งผลกระทบไป\nถึงรถไฟที่มุ่งหน้าไปสถานีโอเอซิสใหญ่",
  "DescTW": "星野和陽奈雙方都拚盡全力與對方交戰，戰鬥的影響波及到開往綠洲站的火車。",
  "DialogJP": [
    {
      "Text": "第29話;激戦（２）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "ヒナ",
      "Text": "……また逃げた？"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "ホシノ",
      "Text": "こっちだよ。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "ヒナ",
      "Text": "くっ……！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "ホシノ",
      "Text": "……！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "ホシノ",
      "Text": "関係者でもない人には……。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "ホシノ",
      "Text": "[ruby=ど]退[/ruby]いてもらおうかなっ！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "ヒナ",
      "Text": "ぐっ！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "ホシノ",
      "Text": "邪魔、しないで……風紀委員長ちゃん！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "ホシノ",
      "Text": "これは、アビドスの……ううん、私の問題だよ！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "ヒナ",
      "Text": "関係なら、ある。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "ホシノ",
      "Text": "……どういうこと？"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "ホシノ",
      "Text": "先生に頼まれたから……とかっ！？"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "ヒナ",
      "Text": "はぁっ……！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "ホシノ",
      "Text": "（このままじゃ、列車がもたない……！）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "ホシノ",
      "Text": "（……上に出ないと！）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "ホシノ",
      "Text": "はぁ……はぁ……。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "ヒナ",
      "Text": "はぁ、はぁ……。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "ホシノ",
      "Text": "……諦めが悪いねぇ。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "ヒナ",
      "Text": "そうね、よく言われるかも。 "
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "ホシノ",
      "Text": "（風紀委員長ちゃんの目的は、私の大オアシス駅行きの阻止）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "ホシノ",
      "Text": "（となると……列車を止めるか、私を落とすかの二択が考えられる）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "ヒナ",
      "Text": "……。 "
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "ホシノ",
      "Text": "（先にあっちを落とせば、もう追いつけなくなるはず）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "ホシノ",
      "Text": "（そのためには……）"
    },
    {
      "Text": "次回;手帳の存在"
    }
  ],
  "DialogKR": [
    {
      "Text": "제29화;격전 2"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "히나",
      "Text": "……사라졌다?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "호시노",
      "Text": "이쪽이야."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "히나",
      "Text": "큭……!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "호시노",
      "Text": "……!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "호시노",
      "Text": "뭐야…… 어째서 네가……?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "호시노",
      "Text": "이건 너랑 아무 상관 없는 일이야……!! 비켜!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "히나",
      "Text": "……, 으그으윽……!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "호시노",
      "Text": "방해, 하지 마……! 선도부장……, 이건……! "
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "호시노",
      "Text": "내 문제……야! 아비도스의……!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "히나",
      "Text": "상관……, 있어."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "호시노",
      "Text": "뭐……?!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "호시노",
      "Text": "설마 선생님이 보낸 거야? 그치만……."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "히나",
      "Text": "흐읍-!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "호시노",
      "Text": "(이대로라면 열차 칸이 떨어져 나갈 거야……!!)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "호시노",
      "Text": "(위로 올라가지 않으면……!)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "호시노",
      "Text": "하아…… 하아……."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "히나",
      "Text": "……하아."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "호시노",
      "Text": "……. 꽤 끈질기네. 선도부장 쨩. "
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "히나",
      "Text": "아아. 자주 듣는 말이야. "
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "호시노",
      "Text": "(선도부장이 선생님의 부탁으로 온 거면…… 내가 오아시스역으로 가지 못하게 저지하는 것이 목표…….)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "호시노",
      "Text": "(아마 기차의 최선두 엔진 칸을 파괴하거나, 아니면 나를 여기서 떨어트릴 셈이겠지.)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "히나",
      "Text": "……. "
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "호시노",
      "Text": "(선도부장을 기차에서 떨어트리고 내가 이 기차에 계속 남아 있을 수 있는 방법을 찾아야 해…….)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "호시노",
      "Text": "(그런 방법은…….)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "다음화;알 수 없는 것"
    }
  ],
  "DialogEN": [
    {
      "Text": "Episode 29;A Fearsome Clash 2"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "Hina",
      "Text": "...She's gone?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "Hoshino",
      "Text": "Over here."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "Hina",
      "Text": "Augh!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "Hoshino",
      "Text": "...!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "Hoshino",
      "Text": "What is this? Why are you...?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "Hoshino",
      "Text": "This has nothing to do with you! Get out of my way!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "Hina",
      "Text": "...Aughhh...!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "Hoshino",
      "Text": "Stop interfering! Head Prefect... This... "
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "Hoshino",
      "Text": "...is my problem! Abydos...!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "Hina",
      "Text": "It's my problem too..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "Hoshino",
      "Text": "What...?!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "Hoshino",
      "Text": "Did Sensei send you? But..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "Hina",
      "Text": "Haaah!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "Hoshino",
      "Text": "(At this rate, the train car will derail!)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "Hoshino",
      "Text": "(Unless we go up...!)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "Hoshino",
      "Text": "*huff*... *huff*..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "Hina",
      "Text": "*sigh*"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "Hoshino",
      "Text": "...You're quite persistent, Head Prefect. "
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "Hina",
      "Text": "Ah. Yes. I do hear that quite a bit. "
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "Hoshino",
      "Text": "(If she's here at Sensei's request...her goal is probably to stop me from reaching Great Oasis Station...)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "Hoshino",
      "Text": "(She'll probably try to destroy the front engine car or make me fall off.)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "Hina",
      "Text": "... "
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "Hoshino",
      "Text": "(I need to find a way to make her fall off, without me going over too.)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "Hoshino",
      "Text": "(The only way is...)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "Next Episode;Things Unknown"
    }
  ],
  "DialogTH": [
    {
      "Text": "ตอนที่ 29;สงครามร้อน 2"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "ฮินะ",
      "Text": "หายไปแล้วเหรอ...?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "โฮชิโนะ",
      "Text": "ทางนี้"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "ฮินะ",
      "Text": "อึก...!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "โฮชิโนะ",
      "Text": "...!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "โฮชิโนะ",
      "Text": "อะไรกัน... ทำไมเธอถึงได้...?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "โฮชิโนะ",
      "Text": "เรื่องนี้ไม่เกี่ยวอะไรกับเธอเลย...!! หลบไปซะ!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "ฮินะ",
      "Text": "อึก...!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "โฮชิโนะ",
      "Text": "อย่ามาขวางฉันนะ...! ประธานกรรมการวินัย... เรื่องนี้น่ะ...!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "โฮชิโนะ",
      "Text": "มันเป็นปัญหาของฉัน...! มันเป็นเรื่องของอะบิดอส...!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "ฮินะ",
      "Text": "ฉัน... ก็เกี่ยวด้วย"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "โฮชิโนะ",
      "Text": "ว่าไงนะ...?!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "โฮชิโนะ",
      "Text": "อย่าบอกนะว่าคุณครูส่งเธอมาน่ะ? แต่ว่า..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "ฮินะ",
      "Text": "ฮึบ!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "โฮชิโนะ",
      "Text": "(ขืนเป็นอย่างนี้ มีหวังได้ตกจากตู้รถไฟแน่ๆ...!!)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "โฮชิโนะ",
      "Text": "(ถ้าไม่ขึ้นไปข้างบนละก็...!)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "โฮชิโนะ",
      "Text": "แฮ่ก... แฮ่ก..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "ฮินะ",
      "Text": "แฮ่ก..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "โฮชิโนะ",
      "Text": "ดื้อใช้ได้เลยนะ... ประธานกรรมการวินัยจัง"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "ฮินะ",
      "Text": "อื้ม ฉันก็ได้ยินคำนี้บ่อยๆ"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "โฮชิโนะ",
      "Text": "(ถ้าประธานกรรมการวินัยมาที่นี่เพราะคุณครูขอไว้... แปลว่าเป้าหมายของเธอคือการขัดขวาง\nไม่ให้ฉันไปที่สถานีโอเอซิส)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "โฮชิโนะ",
      "Text": "(คงจะทำลายตู้เครื่องยนต์ที่อยู่ข้างหน้าสุดของขบวน หรือไม่ก็ผลักฉันให้ตกจากรถไฟไปสินะ)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "ฮินะ",
      "Text": "..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "โฮชิโนะ",
      "Text": "(ต้องหาวิธีทำให้ประธานกรรมการวินัยตกจากรถไฟนี่ซะ แล้วฉันก็ต้องอยู่บนรถไฟขบวนนี้ต่อให้ได้...)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "โฮชิโนะ",
      "Text": "(วิธีแบบนั้น...)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "ตอนต่อไป;สิ่งที่ไม่อาจรู้ได้"
    }
  ],
  "DialogTW": [
    {
      "Text": "第29話;激戰（２）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "陽奈",
      "Text": "……消失了？"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "星野",
      "Text": "在這邊。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "陽奈",
      "Text": "唔……！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "星野",
      "Text": "……！！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "星野",
      "Text": "搞什麼……你為什麼……？"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "星野",
      "Text": "這根本不關你的事……！！閃開！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "陽奈",
      "Text": "唔……！！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "星野",
      "Text": "別礙事……風紀委員長！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "星野",
      "Text": "這是……我的問題！是阿拜多斯的問題……！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "陽奈",
      "Text": "這件事跟我也有關係。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "星野",
      "Text": "什麼……！？"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "星野",
      "Text": "難道是老師要你來的？可是……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "陽奈",
      "Text": "哈啊……！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "星野",
      "Text": "（這樣下去列車會脫軌的……！！）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "星野",
      "Text": "（得往上爬才行……！）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "星野",
      "Text": "哈啊……哈啊……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "陽奈",
      "Text": "哈啊……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "星野",
      "Text": "……真頑強啊，風紀委員長醬。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "陽奈",
      "Text": "是啊，我常聽人這麼說。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "星野",
      "Text": "（如果風紀委員長是被老師找來……那麼他的目的就是阻止我到達大綠洲站……）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "星野",
      "Text": "（所以應該會想破壞火車前方的引擎，或是讓我掉下火車吧）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 703456608,
      "Name": "陽奈",
      "Text": "…… "
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "星野",
      "Text": "（必須想辦法留在車上，並且讓風紀委員長掉下火車……）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1245861359,
      "Name": "星野",
      "Text": "（那麼就該……）"
    },
    {
      "Text": "下一話;未知的事物"
    }
  ]
}